  "description": "<p><strong>Scenario:</strong> DISABLED TEMPLATE. This special path is only for a reactor that has a compatible Item Macro command stored on its source Item via DAE/DIME or supported legacy Item Macro storage. Set the trigger to ItemMacro (or ItemMacro, postActiveEffects), keep activation exactly damage, and do not also register the same command in Midi-QoL On Use Macro stages. Enable only after configuring and testing the macro.</p><p><strong>Setup:</strong> Drag this Active Effect onto the actor who should own the External Reaction option. All changes use Override mode. If an option has a count requirement, that resource is spent when the option is accepted, according to External Reaction's count handling.</p>",
